---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<div class="container">
  <h2>欢迎来到 <code>i.mcenahle.page</code>！</h2>
  <p>我是一名安静的大专男生。</p>
  <p>个人爱好：计算机代码、医学知识和自己的闲暇生活。</p>
  <p>你可以在下面找到我的所有的 <code>.mcenahle.page</code> 网站：</p>

  <ul id="myTab" class="nav nav-tabs">
    <li class="active">
      <a href="#hi" data-toggle="tab">主页网站</a>
    </li>
    <li><a href="#mail" data-toggle="tab">邮箱系统</a></li>
    <li><a href="#blog" data-toggle="tab">博客网站</a></li>
    <li class="dropdown">
      <a href="#" id="myTabDrop1" class="dropdown-toggle" data-toggle="dropdown"
        >其它杂项
        <b class="caret"></b>
      </a>
      <ul class="dropdown-menu" role="menu" aria-labelledby="myTabDrop1">
        <li><a href="#devdocs" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">devdocs</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sponsor" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">赞助页</a></li>
        <li><a href="#charity" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">公益记录</a></li>
        <li><a href="#imgbed" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">图床</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="#admin-imgbed" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">图床管理</a>
        </li>
        <li><a href="#mss" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">mc 生存存档</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="#certificates" tabindex="-1" data-toggle="tab">证书存档</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <div id="myTabContent" class="tab-content">
    <div class="tab-pane fade in active" id="hi">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>
        个人主页网站中，主要提供了我的自我介绍，电子邮件等等信息。如有必要时，可通过该方式与我取得联系。
      </p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://hi.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="mail">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>
        邮箱系统用于接收 <code>i@mcenahle.page</code> 的所有邮箱及其发件。
      </p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://mail.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="blog">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>个人主要发文平台。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://blog.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="devdocs">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>开发文档网站。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://devdocs.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="sponsor">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>提供给我赞助的通道。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://sponsor.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="charity">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>记录我参与的所有公益记录。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://charity.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="imgbed">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>我的图床网站。不提供直接访问通道。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary disabled"
        href="https://imgbed.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="admin-imgbed">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>管理我的图床。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://admin.imgbed.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="mss">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p class="text-warning">
        由于性能问题和代码问题，计划进行一次重构。具体时间待定。
      </p>
      <p>记录我的 mc 存档。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://mss.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="certificates">
      <p class="text-success">现行状态：运行中</p>
      <p>记录我获得的证书。</p>
      <p class="text-warning">此网站的部分内容需要通过验证才能访问。</p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-primary"
        href="https://certificates.mcenahle.page"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        role="button">跳转 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
